      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 Lean `DividendAlgorithm.py`。`add_equity(\"MSFT\",Daily)` + `RAW`；`BrokerageName.TRADIER_BROKERAGE`。`on_data`：若 `orders_count==0` → `set_holdings(\"MSFT\",0.5)`；`quantity=calculate_order_quantity(...,0.25)` → `stop_market_order(MSFT,−quantity, bar.low/2)` 与 `limit_order(MSFT,−quantity, bar.high*2)`。日志股息与拆股；拆股调整未成交单。不是空仓满仓无保护单核，也不是仅自定义波动率满仓核（W546）。提出日期未知。MSFT RAW半仓+止损(低/2)+限价(高×2)收股息 ≠ 空仓满仓无保护单/自定义波动满仓（W546）。计入美股/ETF。提出日期按源文件原样保留未知。"
